Provenance / note for this vendored copy
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This directory is an unmodified copy of the official Timbermesh Blender Plugin
v1.2.0 (bl_info version (1, 2, 0), author "Mechanistry sp. z o.o."), taken from
the local SDK download at
    C:\Users\user\.hdbf\sdk\blender-plugin\timbermesh_blender_plugin
for reproducible headless exports inside this workspace.

Upstream project: https://github.com/mechanistry/timbermesh
The upstream release archive did not ship a standalone LICENSE file; the
plugin's own wiki page ("Timbermesh Blender Plugin manual", License section)
states: "Timbermesh Blender Plugin is licensed under the MIT License."
This file reproduces that MIT license and is kept together with the sources as
the license file the vendoring instructions require.

The bundled pure-python protobuf runtime under google/protobuf/ keeps its own
upstream license in google/protobuf/LICENSE.txt (BSD-3-Clause).
